ications">700</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Vented closed-toe casual shoes with full heel coverage and a sculpted sole profile for a summer casual assortment. The current public source confirms EVA upper material. Separate lining, midsole and ground-contact outsole compositions are not specified. Black, Grey and Khaki options with five paired size labels: 36-37, 38-39, 40-41, 42-43 and 44-45. Send your colour-size quantities, fit requirements and destination for order-specific confirmation.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. supports footwear development and wholesale inquiries. The company capability images below describe general business capabilities. Product-specific availability, samples, customization, packing and dispatch are assessed against your order requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What materials are confirmed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The current source attributes confirm an EVA upper. Separate lining, midsole and ground-contact outsole compositions are not specified. Send any layer-specific material requirements for confirmation before order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colours and sizes can I request?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Black, Grey and Khaki. The source uses paired size labels 36-37, 38-39, 40-41, 42-43 and 44-45; these remain five choices, not ten separate sizes. Send fit requirements for confirmation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What is the minimum order and reference price?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The minimum order is 2 pairs. Reference prices are USD 3.36 for 2-49 pairs, USD 3.14 for 50-99 pairs and USD 2.92 for 100 pairs or more. Freight and final order terms are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How do I confirm the assortment?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Share quantities for each colour and paired size label. Current availability, agreed fit measurements and packing requirements are confirmed for your order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or custom packaging?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity, packaging and branding requirements. Feasibility, charges, minimum quantities and timing are assessed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How are dispatch and delivery arranged?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send the destination, quantities and required date. Packing, freight options and dispatch timing are confirmed against the agreed order.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>